msgid "With some trepidation, you give the shipyard owner your money and take your new ship for a test drive, piloting it out of the shipyard and onto a spare landing pad by the spaceport. Then you get out and look the ship over a bit more closely. You are busy polishing out a few rust spots with a piece of steel wool when an old man in grease-stained coveralls walks up."
msgstr "你有些忐忑地把钱交给造船厂老板，驾驶新船试航，从船厂开到太空港旁一个空着的着陆平台上。随后你下船，更仔细地打量它。正忙着用钢丝绒打磨几处锈斑时，一位穿着沾满油渍工作服的老人走了过来。"

