msgid "By now, your entire ship smells like brine and raw fish, but as best you can tell the fish is still fresh enough to eat. The dock workers on "
msgstr "现在，整艘船都弥漫着盐水和生鱼的气味，不过据你判断，这些鱼应该还新鲜，能吃。"

msgid "Your cargo has loomed silently in your hold for the last few days, but as far as you can tell, the samples are still safely contained. The dock workers on "
msgstr "这几天，那批货一直静静待在货舱里，让人隐隐不安。不过据你判断，样本仍被安全封存着。"

msgid "Your cargo has loomed silently in your hold for the last few days, but the radiation alarms in your ship's hold haven't let out a squeak. The dock workers on "
msgstr "这几天，那批货一直静静待在货舱里，让人隐隐不安，不过货舱中的辐射警报器始终没有响过。"

msgid "You find James talking with a group of miners, who seem to be old acquaintances of his. As you approach, he says, \"Well guys, here comes my ride. I should probably say goodbye.\" They head back off to do their work. \"Every time I land here,\" says James, \"I'm amazed that this station hasn't been wiped out yet by a meteorite. Can you imagine spending your life here?\""
msgstr "你发现詹姆斯正和一群矿工聊天，他们似乎都是老相识。你走近时，他说：“好了，各位，我的船来了，该告辞了。”他们回去继续工作。“每次在这里着陆，”詹姆斯说，“我都惊讶这个空间站居然还没被陨石砸毁。你能想象一辈子待在这里吗？”"

