msgid "Once you've landed, you meet up with James and he asks you, \"What did you think of mining?\""
msgstr "着陆后，你和詹姆斯碰面。他问你：“觉得采矿怎么样？”"

msgid "You find James sitting at the spaceport's tiny bar, sipping a beer while watching the large displays that show the landing pads and the irrigated fields beyond. The displays are supposed to make the underground building feel less claustrophobic."
msgstr "你发现詹姆斯坐在太空港的小酒吧里，一边喝啤酒，一边看着大型显示屏。屏上显示着着陆平台和远处灌溉农田的景象，为的是让这座地下建筑不那么压抑。"

msgid "As you check over the specs of your brand new "
msgstr "最后一次查看崭新的"

msgid "You prepare to board your new ship and take it for a test flight, only to find it is an automated drone that lacks a crew compartment entirely! Unless you want to try strapping yourself on the outside of the hull, you'll need to sell off your drone and buy a proper spacefaring vessel."
msgstr "你准备登上新船试飞，却发现它是一架自动无人机，根本没有船员舱！除非你想把自己绑在船体外面，否则得卖掉无人机，买艘真正适合载人航行的飞船。"

